[gd_scene format=3]

; The machine arena (M5): the first species living side by side on a flooded hall floor, for look-dev
; and for watching their behaviors. West to east: a congregation of Votaries praying toward a shrine
; (a gallery above lets the player pass over their reach), a Gleaner picking over scrap, and a Limpet
; asleep on a metal reliquary; a Lamplighter waits near the start. Run it with `-- --room MachineArena`.

